.TH HAG-INFO 1 "May 2025" "Hag 0.1.0" "Hag AI Compute Runtime"
.SH NAME
hag-info \- Display information about Hag-compatible GPU devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hag-info
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hag-info
enumerates DRM render nodes on the system and displays basic information
about each GPU device, including vendor and device IDs.
.SH OPTIONS
None currently implemented.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
$ hag-info
Hag Device Enumeration Tool v0.1.0
=====================================

Found 2 DRM device(s):

Device 0:
  Path:     /dev/dri/renderD128
  Vendor:   0x1002 (AMD)
  Device:   0x744C

Device 1:
  Path:     /dev/dri/renderD129
  Vendor:   0x8086 (Intel)
  Device:   0x56A0
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
An error occurred.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hag (3),
.BR drm (7)
